* Cleaned up error handling to let the user app have control (File_IMC_Build::raiseError() no longer passes a PEAR_ERROR_* to PEAR::raiseError()) (thanks, Greg)
* Minor documentation additions/modifications (thanks, Greg)";}i:4;a:5:{s:7:"version";a:2:{s:7:"release";s:3:"0.2";s:3:"api";s:3:"0.2";}s:9:"stability";a:2:{s:7:"release";s:4:"beta";s:3:"api";s:4:"beta";}s:4:"date";s:10:"2003-09-22";s:7:"license";a:2:{s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:3:"uri";s:26:"http://www.php.net/license";}s:8:"_content";s:11:"PHP License";}s:5:"notes";s:507:"* Added preliminary vCalendar parsing support.  Has yet to be tested with complex input files.
* Added vCard build support from Contact_Vcard_Build.
* File_IMC_Parse can now handle nested BEGIN/END blocks (to support vCal).
* Included example scripts and sample vCard and vCalendar files.

IMPORTANT: The array structure has changed slightly from Contact_Vcard_Parse.
